<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-4573] Disable zeppelin-web war file extraction when pointing to a .war file</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-4573</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The local extraction of zeppelin-web.war file can create some problems:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;We observe that sometimes the local zeppelin-web extraction gets corrupted following the termination of Zeppelin process. This leads to issues with launching Zeppelin at any subsequent run.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The extraction of zeppelin-web.war process also adds to the Zeppelin launch time, making it unnecessarily slower.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
